@startuml usecase_sv4
title LocalPress — Finance, Payment and Accounting (SV4, UC047 - UC060)

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam nodesep 14
skinparam ranksep 90

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #66BBE2
    BorderColor #000000
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor black
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 14
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #66BBE2
    BorderColor #000000
    FontColor black
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor #000000
    BorderThickness 1
    FontColor black
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam arrow {
    Color #000000
    FontColor #000000
    FontSize 10
}

' Actors Left
actor "CUSTOMER\nReader / Advertiser" as Customer
actor "ACCOUNTANT\nFinance Staff" as Accountant
actor "CHIEF ACCOUNTANT\nApprover (2nd eye)" as Chief

' System Boundary
rectangle "LocalPress System" {

    ' Customer payment
    usecase "Create Payment Transaction\nUC047" as UC047
    usecase "Generate SePay QR Code" as GenQR
    usecase "Pay With Wallet" as PayWallet
    usecase "Top Up Wallet" as TopUp
    usecase "Check Payment Status\nUC050" as UC050

    ' Gateway
    usecase "Handle Payment Webhook\nUC049" as UC049
    usecase "Verify Payment Result\nUC048" as UC048

    ' Complaint (replaces manual transfer approval)
    usecase "Handle Unrecorded Payment Complaint\nUC051" as UC051
    usecase "Match Bank Statement" as MatchStmt

    ' Ledger & documents
    usecase "View Financial Ledger\nUC058" as UC058
    usecase "Generate Financial Documents\nUC057" as UC057

    ' Receivables, reconciliation, dashboard
    usecase "Manage Advertiser Receivables\nUC053" as UC053
    usecase "Reconcile Payment Mismatch\nUC054" as UC054
    usecase "View Cash Flow Dashboard\nUC052" as UC052
    usecase "Export Financial Report\nUC059" as UC059
    usecase "View Financial Alerts\nUC060" as UC060

    ' Refund
    usecase "Process Refund Request\nUC055" as UC055
    usecase "Adjust Reading or Campaign Rights\nUC056" as UC056
}

' Actors Right
actor "Payment Gateway\nSePay" as Gateway
actor "Bank Partner\nBank Statement" as Bank
actor "SV1 / SV3 Modules\nPaymentSuccessEvent\nRefundCompletedEvent" as Modules

' Customer associations
Customer -- UC047
Customer -- TopUp
Customer -- UC050
Customer -- UC051

' Accountant associations
Accountant -- UC051
Accountant -- UC058
Accountant -- UC057
Accountant -- UC053
Accountant -- UC054
Accountant -- UC055
Accountant -- UC052
Accountant -- UC060

' Chief Accountant associations
Chief -- UC055
Chief -- UC052
Chief -- UC059

' Gateway, bank, modules (right side)
UC049 -- Gateway
MatchStmt -- Bank
UC049 -- Modules
UC056 -- Modules

' Include relationships
UC047 ..> GenQR : <<include>>
TopUp ..> UC047 : <<include>>
UC049 ..> UC048 : <<include>>
UC051 ..> MatchStmt : <<include>>
UC051 ..> UC049 : <<include>>
UC054 ..> MatchStmt : <<include>>
UC055 ..> UC056 : <<include>>

' Extend relationships
PayWallet ..> UC047 : <<extend>>
UC057 ..> UC058 : <<extend>>
UC059 ..> UC052 : <<extend>>

note bottom of "LocalPress System"
Solid lines: actor associations · Dashed arrows: include / extend relationships
UC051 replaces "Confirm Manual Bank Transfer": the customer submits a complaint, the accountant matches the bank statement,
then records it through the same idempotent webhook logic (UC049) - there is no manual "mark as PAID".
UC055 Four-Eyes: proposer (Accountant) and approver (Chief Accountant) are the logged-in users and must differ.
UC055 refund of a wallet-paid order is credited back to the wallet; TOPUP / REFUND transactions cannot be refunded.
UC056 (Rule 17): SV4 never updates SV1 / SV3 tables; it publishes RefundCompletedEvent and their listeners adjust rights.
end note

@enduml
